module gunbc.recurring_failure_mode.absent_reads_identically_to_never_looked

import std.types { NonEmptyStr }
import gunbc.recurring_failure_mode { RecurringFailureMode }

data absent_reads_identically_to_never_looked: RecurringFailureMode = RecurringFailureMode {
  identity: "absent_reads_identically_to_never_looked" as NonEmptyStr,

  receipts: [
    "**a search that never reached its subject returns exactly what a real absence returns** (an instrument that answers `zero occurrences` over a region it never actually read is not reporting a measurement, it is reporting its own miss in the vocabulary of a finding. The two states are indistinguishable in the output -- both are the empty result -- so the reader supplies the interpretation, and the interpretation that fits the question being asked is `absent`. ",

    "THREE SPECIMENS IN ONE NIGHT, TWO SESSIONS, THREE DIFFERENT WAYS OF MISSING THE SUBJECT (2026-09-04, gunbc#10197). WRONG PATH: joining main's 142 `gunbc#10254` admission rows against the tree to decide whether they were consumed, the witness module's file was derived from its module path as `dag/test/claim/spark/spark_oobe_screen_observation_witness.dag`; the real file is `..._witness_test.dag`. The read returned empty and the join reported 128 of 142 rows NOT bound to their target -- the answer that would have had 128 consumed rows CARRIED, and a carried consumed row is a stale admission, which refuses every unrelated pull request in the repository. WRONG WINDOW: a reviewer checking the same claim bounded the import read to lines 13-30 and got zero for the real spelling, because the import block runs well past line 30. WRONG DIRECTORY: an earlier check of the same night grepped `dag/product/...` for a symbol that lives under `dag/gunbc/product/...` and got nothing, which read as `the symbol does not exist` and nearly stood as a finding. ",

    "**THE TELL IS THAT A ZERO WAS ACCEPTED WITHOUT ANYTHING ESTABLISHING THAT THE INSTRUMENT RESOLVED ITS SUBJECT** -- no denominator, no positive control, no assertion that the file read was non-empty or that the window contained what it was supposed to contain. ",

    "The second specimen is the one that shows the shape cleanly: the reviewer ran a FAKE control spelling alongside the real one, got zero for both, and only that pairing revealed the window was wrong rather than the symbol absent. The control cost one extra line and was the entire difference between a measurement and a miss. ",

    "**RECOGNITION RULE: whenever an empty result is about to be read as evidence of absence, ask what the instrument would have returned had it never reached its subject; if that is the same value, the result carries no information and the absence is unestablished.** ",

    "THE REPAIR IS THAT THE INSTRUMENT MUST NOT BE ABLE TO RETURN A VALUE IT CANNOT SHOW IT RESOLVED. A positive control that must hit, or a denominator it must report -- a path read asserts the source is non-empty before its emptiness is allowed to mean anything, a windowed read asserts the window contains a known landmark, a directory search asserts the directory exists. A retry does not repair it: the same wrong path, window or directory returns the same empty result and agrees with itself. ",

    "TWO MECHANISMS WHERE THE INSTRUMENT NEVER EXECUTED OVER ITS SUBJECT AT ALL, probed 2026-09-04 by sessions jolly-deer-769 and royal-carp-732 on a gunbc BUILT FROM THE TREE. The three specimens above are failures of AIM -- the instrument ran and missed -- so the recognition rule they support asks whether it reached its subject. THESE ASK A QUESTION IT DOES NOT: DID IT EXECUTE. FIRST, THE SOURCE ROOT THAT ABORTS BEFORE ANYTHING COMPILES. Three separable arms, distinguished by guard and by ARGUMENT POSITION, each reproduced one variable at a time: a PRIMARY root outside the workspace is a clean typed root-admission refusal and no panic; a root inside the workspace that is not a directory panics in `anchor_source_root`; the SAME out-of-tree path passed as a SECONDARY root panics in `repo_relative_path_normalized`. Containment and existence are different guards, and the identical path is a refusal in one position and a panic in another. NAME THE GUARD, NEVER QUOTE THE MESSAGE: the first write of this receipt quoted `source root does not exist`, which is what the PATH-INSTALLED binary printed; the tree-built binary says something else at the same guard, and a quoted sentence no build emits is the stale-citation class filed one row over. ALL THREE ARMS ARE LOUD -- stderr, non-zero exit. THE SILENCE WAS MANUFACTURED BY THE READER'S FILTER, and that is the sharper statement of this whole class. Measured twice from opposite sides: a grep keyed on the SUBJECT module's own name discards the abort, because the failure message is about the root and never about the subject, so it cannot match; and a count of lines matching `error:` returns zero, because the abort says `panicked at`. AN ALLOWLIST FILTER -- KEYED ON THE SUBJECT OR ON THE DIAGNOSTIC VOCABULARY -- CANNOT DISTINGUISH THE SUBJECT IS CLEAN FROM THE RUN DIED BEFORE REACHING IT. ",

    "SECOND, THE MODULE THE RUN KNOWS AND NEVER COMPILES, and the run prints its own two denominators in one line: `resolved N sources (primary-root population root=dag), M indexed modules in the name census only` -- two populations, both true of the same run, whose sizes are READ FROM THAT LINE rather than stated here, because the gap moves with every merge. THE DISCRIMINATING PAIR, one file and one defect moved between them: a probe carrying a return-type mismatch under the PRIMARY root is compiled and the error reported; the SAME file with the SAME defect under a SECONDARY root joins the name census, is never compiled, produces NO diagnostic, and leaves the blocking error count unchanged. The module is fully KNOWN to the run and never looked at. Path mismatch is NOT the mechanism and was measured not to be: membership keys on the DECLARED module path with the directory only as the value, so a file declaring a namespace its directory does not name is resolvable by name AND is still compiled and diagnosed under a primary root. What survives is the shape rather than the cause -- a directory and a namespace are two populations that read as one, and an instrument standing in either has no way to report that its complement was never in scope. ",

    "AND THE CONTROL DOES NOT DISCRIMINATE UNLESS ITS FAILURE IS VISIBLE IN THE CHANNEL BEING READ -- retracted and re-measured by royal-carp-732 against their own earlier account, which is why it is stated here as the correction rather than as the finding. A must-fail control planted as `Int + String` raises at EVALUATION time and can never appear in `gunbc compile` output; the same intent written as a return-type mismatch is static and does appear. The first control was a genuine defect, genuinely present, in a genuinely compiled module, and COULD NOT HAVE FIRED however well the instrument worked -- it looked rigorous and was inert, which is worse than no control, because it is cited as proof the instrument was live. Choosing a control is not choosing something that must fail; it is choosing something whose failure THAT instrument must report. A runtime defect cannot control a static analysis, and a static defect cannot control a runtime probe. ",

    "THE COST CALIBRATION, which says what the cheap check buys and where it stops: a non-zero exit status catches all three abort arms. It does NOT catch the never-compiled module, where the process exits zero having compiled thousands of modules and simply not the one under test -- AN EXIT CODE IS NOT AN EXECUTION RECEIPT WHEN THE THING THAT DID NOT EXECUTE IS ONE MODULE OUT OF THOUSANDS. Only a must-fail control separates those, and only when control and instrument share a channel. THE CORPUS SIZE IS NOT TRANSCRIBED HERE AND THE INSTRUMENT IS NAMED INSTEAD: `gunbc compile --source-root dag --source-root src/v2` reports both populations on the summary line quoted above, under the policy `gunbc.compile_clean_diagnostic_policy`, and `claim_batch` reports the same denominator as `edge_index_construction.source_files` in its cost-partition receipt. Re-derive it from either producer; the claim rests on the order of magnitude, not on a value. ",

    "**THE ITERATING FORM, WHERE REPETITION MANUFACTURES THE CONFIDENCE INSTEAD OF EARNING IT (2026-09-05, clever-dove-410).** The specimens above are single reads. Put the same miss inside a loop and the harm inverts the reader's strongest heuristic: a harness sweeping a population one shard at a time, whose per-shard failure is INVARIANT, dies identically on every iteration and reports a growing tally of shards that found nothing. That output is byte-for-byte what a genuinely clean population produces, and it gets MORE convincing the longer it runs. ",

    "MEASURED: a chunked census over 1199 modules reported 1199 consecutive rounds of zero progress and a final `PASS=0 FAIL=0 failed_probes=0`. Every round had died in under three seconds on one invariant refusal -- `MemoryCgroupBindRefused: the cgroup2 tree is not writable by this process` -- before reaching any subject, and the loop's own requeue logic then walked the whole queue one dropped head at a time. Nothing in the summary distinguished that from a corpus with no defects in it. ",

    "**THE GUARD IS LIVENESS ACROSS ITERATIONS, NOT A CONTROL WITHIN ONE**, and it is what separates this from its parent form: a positive control proves an instrument CAN report, once; it says nothing about a loop whose every later iteration is dead. The harness must assert its own progress -- refuse after N consecutive iterations that complete no member of the population, and print the raw log of the failing iteration rather than its own tally. Rearmed with that guard, the identical failure was caught on the second occurrence in three seconds. ",

    "A COROLLARY ON WHERE THE REFUSAL CAME FROM, since it is the honest kind: the tool refused to run UNBOUND when the memory bind it was asked for could not be created, which is correct fail-closed behaviour and not a defect. The manufactured silence was entirely the harness's, which is the general shape -- a loud, typed, correct refusal on every iteration, rendered as a clean sweep by the thing counting iterations. ",

    "Distinct from `denominator_moved_between_measurement_and_comparison`, where the instrument reached a real subject that had changed underneath it; here the subject never moved and was never reached. Both are cases of a number that describes the measuring rather than the measured, which is why neither is caught by re-running.)",

    "**THE ABSENCE FAMILY WAS AUDITED FOR A MEANING FORK, IS NOT ONE, AND THE AXIS IS CARRIED HERE BECAUSE THIS IS THE ROW THE OTHERS WOULD BE CONSOLIDATED INTO** (sunny-carp-582, 2026-09-07, commissioned after five specimens in one night were rediscovered against rows that were already written). MEMBERSHIP IS BY SHAPE AND NOT BY SPELLING: the consumed value must be an EMPTINESS and the consumption must be AS AN AFFIRMATIVE VERDICT. Nine rows qualify -- this one, [[predicate_vacuously_true_on_an_empty_domain]], [[empty_observation_narrow]], [[empty_capture_read_as_clean_result]], [[edit_pass_that_matched_nothing_reports_success]], [[required_evidence_absent_reads_as_evidence_of_pass]], [[absence_classifier_default_bucket]], [[witness_that_fails_to_compile_is_absent_rather_than_red]] and [[agreement_over_absorbed_classes_that_are_empty]]. THE AXIS THAT SEPARATES THEM IS WHAT IS ABSENT AND WHAT WOULD SUPPLY IT, and the test that they are neighbours rather than one class is that THE REPAIRS ARE PAIRWISE NON-SUBSTITUTABLE. Here the absent thing is the INSTRUMENT'S REACH and the supply is a positive control or denominator; in the vacuity row the domain is GENUINELY empty and the check ran correctly, so the supply is a bound on the domain and no control would fire; in the classifier row a KIND is missing from an OPEN enumeration and the supply is carrying the kind at construction; in the gate row the set is CLOSED AND ALREADY CORRECT and empty only inside the demand-to-arrival window, so the supply is inverting the quantifier and an exhaustive kind match would leave it admitting exactly as before. A positive control does not close an open enumeration, an exhaustive match does not decide whether a required record has yet arrived, and a domain bound does not make an unreached instrument report. NINE NEIGHBOURS, NO FORK. ",

    "**THE SAME AUDIT MEASURED WHY THE FAMILY IS NOT CONSULTED, AND THE ANSWER IS NOT THAT THE ROSTER SITS SOMEWHERE AUTHORS DO NOT GO.** Across those nine members, at the head audited, there was exactly ONE intra-family boundary citation in the entire family -- the vacuity row naming [[empty_observation_narrow]] -- and eight of nine rows named no sibling at all. THE FAMILY IS THEREFORE UNREACHABLE FROM ITS OWN MEMBERS AT READING TIME, not merely un-surfaced at authoring time, and the distinction decides the remedy: a mechanism that put the RIGHT ROW in front of an author would still have put an ISLAND in front of them. The aggravating measurement is that [[empty_capture_read_as_clean_result]] DID name this row -- as the nickname `blank is not evidence` -- so the one existing edge was invisible to the identity join that found the other eight missing. A NICKNAME IS NOT A WEAKER CITATION, IT IS A DELETED EDGE, which is the DESIGN section 3 argument arriving as a measurement rather than as a principle. ",

    "NOT MEMBERS, RECORDED BECAUSE THE IDENTITY SPELLING WOULD ADMIT THEM AND A LATER CONSOLIDATION MUST NOT. [[identity_absent_graph_traversal]] names an absence in the SUBSTRATE -- no identity the model is allowed to name -- and produces no verdict at all, so merging it here would fold a capability gap into a misreading class. [[receipt_whose_competent_refuter_is_absent]] is an absent PARTY, not an absent observation. [[non_execution_undifferentiated_by_what_it_silenced]] reports UNDECIDED rather than pass; its defect is that undecided is undifferentiated by consequence. [[required_lane_green_over_a_population_it_never_offered]] and [[green_reported_over_a_population_the_instrument_does_not_own]] report correctly over a non-empty set they own and are defective in DENOMINATOR SCOPE, which [[roster_is_its_own_denominator]] already separates itself from. [[undecided_fraction_read_as_denominator]] collapses a THIRD disposition rather than an emptiness. [[sweep_terminated_by_process_death_rather_than_a_typed_refusal]] produces no typed refusal at all. [[executed_conjunct_discriminates_nothing]] and [[closure_subject_with_no_enumerable_membership]] are bounded away in the vacuity row own text. ",
  ],

  evidence: [],
}
